name: sim.getLightParameters
description: Deprecated. See properties instead
luaSynopsis: int state, list zero, list diffusePart, list specularPart = sim.getLightParameters(int objectHandle)
pythonSynopsis: int state, float[3] zero, float[3] diffusePart, float[3] specularPart = sim.getLightParameters(int objectHandle)
inputs:
1. objectHandle: handle of the light
outputs:
1. state:bit-coded: for now, only bit 0 is used: 1=light on.
2. zero: ignore this value
3. diffusePart: red, green and blue component of the light's diffuse part
4. specularPart: red, green and blue component of the light's specular part
replacedBy:
- name: enabled, class: light, file: light_enabled.property
- name: lightColor.diffuse, class: light, file: lightColor_diffuse.property
- name: lightColor.specular, class: light, file: lightColor_specular.property
- name: lightColor.emission, class: light, file: lightColor_emission.property
